ra2-r2basij-name = Basij Rifleman
ra2-r2basij-description = Low-cost mobile rifle screen.
    Strong vs infantry; weak vs armor, splash and aircraft.

ra2-r2toophan-name = Toophan AT Team
ra2-r2toophan-description = Long-range anti-tank ambush team; conceals when idle.
    Stationary: 15% shorter reload. Minimum range: 2 cells.
    Weak vs infantry and aircraft.

ra2-r2dronecontrol-name = Drone Coordinator
ra2-r2dronecontrol-description = Reconnaissance and cloaked-target detection.
    Mohajer, Toufan and Azar within 7 cells: 20% shorter reload.
    Light carbine; fragile without escorts. Bonuses do not stack.

ra2-r2shadowone-name = Shadow One
ra2-r2shadowone-description = Unique stealth commando; conceals while idle.
    Anti-infantry weapon and close-range structure sabotage.
    Counter with detection, armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2coast-name = Coastal Missile Launcher
ra2-r2coast-description = Long-range two-missile salvo vs ships and structures only.
    Minimum range: 4 cells. Long reload; bring an escort.
    Cannot engage tanks, infantry or aircraft.

ra2-r2toufan-name = Toufan Gunship
ra2-r2toufan-description = Rocket gunship vs infantry and light vehicles.
    Weak vs heavy tanks; vulnerable to dedicated AA.
    Produced at the War Factory.

ra2-r2azar-name = Azar Strike Aircraft
ra2-r2azar-description = Fast strafing strikes vs armor and buildings.
    Long reload between passes. Weak vs interceptors and AA.
    Produced at the War Factory; no airfield required.

ra2-r2loiter-name = Loiter Munition
ra2-r2loiter-description = Expendable unmanned precision strike.
    Consumed after one close-range attack; intercepted by AA.
    Best vs exposed armor and costly structures.

ra2-r2peykaap-name = Peykaap Missile Craft
ra2-r2peykaap-description = Fast missile boat with short-range defensive AA and sonar.
    Light armor; use hit-and-run attacks, not sustained fights.
    Cannot attack submerged targets.

ra2-r2ghadir-name = Ghadir Submarine
ra2-r2ghadir-description = Fast concealed torpedo ambusher with sonar.
    Surfaces when firing or damaged, then recloaks.
    Strong vs ships; cannot attack land or air.

ra2-r2irbunker-name = Gun Bunker
ra2-r2irbunker-description = Durable inexpensive anti-infantry strongpoint.
    Short range; weak vs armor and artillery. Requires power.

ra2-r2iraasite-name = Raad AA Site
ra2-r2iraasite-description = Three-missile air-defense salvo.
    Long reload creates an opening for follow-up attacks.
    Cannot attack ground targets; requires power.

ra2-r2ircoast-name = Denial Missile Battery
ra2-r2ircoast-description = Long-range twin missiles vs armor and ships.
    Minimum range: 3 cells. Weak vs infantry and artillery.
    Requires power.
